koronus-expedition-monolith-title = A shard that remembers
koronus-expedition-monolith-summary = An impossible fragment has appeared in local space. Its chambers conceal a relic and hostile echoes. Recover the shielded casket and leave the fragment to secure archeotech supplies. Deliver the casket to Footfall's astropathic intake. Prepare for EVA and close combat.
koronus-expedition-weapons-cache-title = The arms broker's last inventory
koronus-expedition-weapons-cache-summary = Chaos heretics have occupied an isolated weapons depot. Recover their sealed ledger before the trail goes cold. Extract it for engineering supplies, then deliver it to the cargo Officio on Footfall. Bring EVA gear, breaching tools and cover against the guards' lasguns.
koronus-expedition-vault-title = The forgotten charter
koronus-expedition-vault-summary = A lost merchant vault has surfaced with its charter bonds intact. Scavengers are already inside. Breach the vault, recover the bonds and extract them for engineering supplies. The cargo Officio on Footfall accepts the documents. EVA equipment and tools for sealed doors are essential.
koronus-expedition-raider-boarding-title = Cut the smuggler's route
koronus-expedition-raider-boarding-summary = A raider ship has fallen silent between jumps. Its crew still protects a ledger of clandestine routes. Board the ship and extract the ledger for engineering supplies; deliver the evidence to Footfall's cargo Officio. Prepare EVA gear and a boarding team.
koronus-expedition-wreck-salvage-title = What the void left behind
koronus-expedition-wreck-salvage-summary = A damaged civilian wreck is broadcasting a fading recorder signal. Search the compartments and extract its data core to secure engineering supplies. Footfall's archive accepts the recovered record. No armed crew has been detected; bring EVA gear and tools for the damaged hull.
koronus-expedition-wreck-rescue-title = One life in the debris
koronus-expedition-wreck-rescue-summary = A wrecked medical ship still carries a living survivor. Locate them and carry them off the wreck to secure medical supplies. Deliver the survivor to Footfall's Medicae intake. Bring EVA equipment and prepare a safe evacuation route.
koronus-expedition-basalt-survey-title = The black prospect
koronus-expedition-basalt-survey-summary = Auspex has marked a promising basalt asteroid. Land on the exposed terrain, recover a labelled assay core and extract it for mineral supplies. The Miners' Guild on Footfall accepts the sample. The site is in vacuum: bring EVA gear.
koronus-expedition-snow-rescue-title = A voice under the frost
koronus-expedition-snow-rescue-summary = A frozen asteroid carries a weak life signal and distorted vox echoes. Find the survivor, avoid the hostile apparitions and carry them off the site for medical supplies. Deliver them to Footfall's Medicae intake. EVA gear is essential.
koronus-expedition-cave-survey-title = The burrow's secret
koronus-expedition-cave-survey-summary = A cave asteroid carries an unfamiliar biosignal. Recover a sealed sample while holding off the hormagaunts, then extract it for xenology supplies. Footfall's astropathic intake accepts the specimen. Bring EVA gear and close-range weapons.
koronus-expedition-chromite-survey-title = The disputed seam
koronus-expedition-chromite-survey-summary = Raiders have occupied a chromite prospect. Recover its labelled assay core and extract it for mineral supplies. Deliver the sample to Footfall's Miners' Guild. Prepare EVA equipment and a boarding team.
koronus-expedition-scrap-survey-title = A memory in the scrap
koronus-expedition-scrap-survey-summary = A drifting scrap field hides an intact cogitator core. Scavengers have claimed the site. Recover the core and extract it for engineering supplies; Footfall's archive accepts the record. Bring EVA equipment and expect resistance.
koronus-expedition-infested-ship-title = A heartbeat in the hull
koronus-expedition-infested-ship-summary = A silent vessel is infested with Tyranids. Board it, recover the quarantined sample and escape with it for xenology supplies. Footfall's astropathic intake accepts the specimen. Hormagaunts hunt through the corridors: bring EVA gear, close-range weapons and cover your extraction route.
koronus-expedition-machine-salvage-title = The watch that never ended
koronus-expedition-machine-salvage-summary = An ancient machine complex has awoken under Necron watch. Recover its cogitator core and extract it for archeotech supplies; deliver the record to Footfall's archive. Expect autonomous constructs with ranged weapons. Bring EVA gear, armour and breaching tools, and use the machinery as cover.

