ent-KoronusExpeditionContrabandLedger = sealed contraband ledger
    .desc = A smuggler's ledger with route codes and cargo seals. Extract it and deliver it to the cargo Officio on Footfall.
ent-KoronusExpeditionSealedBonds = recovered charter bonds
    .desc = Sealed proof of a lost merchant charter. Extract it and deliver it to the cargo Officio on Footfall.
ent-KoronusExpeditionOreCore = expedition assay core
    .desc = A labelled sample from an uncharted asteroid. Extract it and deliver it to the Miners' Guild on Footfall.
ent-KoronusExpeditionSurvivor = stranded expedition survivor
    .desc = A living survivor in a sealed evacuation harness. Carry them off the site and deliver them to the Medicae intake on Footfall.

