    .desc = A hardened scavenger protecting a claim in the void.
ent-MobKoronusExpeditionEcho = voidbound warp echo
    .desc = A hostile reflection that follows the living through airless ruins.
ent-MobKoronusExpeditionHeretic = heretic depot guard
    .desc = A void-equipped heretic guarding stolen weapons with a lasgun.
